  m_Name: Lore7
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_7
  title: The Four Families
  fullText: 'The fog in my mind begins to fade...


    The families.


    They
    mean much more than just faith.

    They are bound to the cards.

    Bound
    to memory.


    I understand that now.

    Yet something still feels wrong...


    Did
    I choose the wrong family?

    Or did I simply walk the wrong path.


    Do
    not forget the families...

    Try to Remember.'
